<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 2585 0 R/Alt(Block diagram: three boxes on the left, embedded DSLs (Chisel, SpinalHDL, Amaranth, Clash), standalone HDLs (Bluespec, Veryl, Spade, Silice), and HLS and compiler IRs (XLS, Calyx, C/C++ HLS), point with arrows labeled generate into a central box of standardized HDLs (SystemVerilog, Verilog, VHDL). From there, arrows lead to three boxes on the right: simulation (Icarus Verilog, Verilator, GHDL), linting (Verilator, Verible, slang), and synthesis and layout (Yosys, LibreLane).)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[60]/Pg 30471 0 R>>
