13477 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 13478 0 R/Alt(Schematic of three flip-flops and three multiplexers. wdata_i goes to input 1 of two multiplexers, one per stored bit. Each of them drives the D input of a flip-flop, mem_q[0] and mem_q[1], whose Q output returns to input 0 of the same multiplexer. The selects are we_i and not addr_i for mem_q[0], and we_i and addr_i for mem_q[1]. Both Q outputs go to a read multiplexer selected by addr_i, which drives the D input of the flip-flop rdata_q, whose output is rdata_o. clk_i clocks all three flip-flops.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[24]/Pg 30558 0 R>>
endobj
